  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto+Mono:wght@400;500&amp;display=swap" media="all"><section class="ts-template--27416866160925__number_highlight_stats_zdJijJ" data-section-id="template--27416866160925__number_highlight_stats_zdJijJ" data-section-type="section-stats">
  <div class="ts__inner"><header class="ts__head"><h2 class="ts__title">The most complete picture of  how your body is aging</h2><p class="ts__sub">One finger prick,  75+ biomarkers — the full view of how you're aging.</p></header><div class="ts__grid"><div class="ts__item"><span class="ts__num">75+</span><span class="ts__label">Biomarkers</span><p class="ts__desc">A look at how your immune system is functioning, plus signs of smoking or alcohol-related risk.</p></div><div class="ts__item"><span class="ts__num">11</span><span class="ts__label">Organ systems</span><p class="ts__desc">Individual epigenetic age scores — brain, heart, liver and more.</p></div><div class="ts__item"><span class="ts__num">1,000,000+</span><span class="ts__label">DNA markers</span><p class="ts__desc">Built on cutting-edge epigenetic research and developed with world-leading scientists.</p></div></div><div class="ts__dots" data-stats-dots="" data-built="1"><button type="button" class="ts__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 1" aria-current="true"></button><button type="button" class="ts__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 2" aria-current="false"></button><button type="button" class="ts__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 3" aria-current="false"></button></div></div>
</section><script>
    (function () {
      function initTsCarousel(sec) {
        var track = sec.querySelector('.ts__grid');
        var dotsWrap = sec.querySelector('[data-stats-dots]');
        if (!track || !dotsWrap || dotsWrap.dataset.built) return;
        dotsWrap.dataset.built = '1';

        var items = track.querySelectorAll('.ts__item');
        if (items.length < 2) return;

        var dots = [];
        items.forEach(function (item, i) {
          var b = document.createElement('button');
          b.type = 'button';
          b.className = 'ts__dot';
          b.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Go to slide ' + (i + 1));
          b.setAttribute('aria-current', i === 0 ? 'true' : 'false');
          b.addEventListener('click', function () {
            var target = item.offsetLeft - track.offsetLeft;
            if ('scrollBehavior' in document.documentElement.style) {
              track.scrollTo({ left: target, behavior: 'smooth' });
            } else {
              track.scrollLeft = target;
            }
          });
          dotsWrap.appendChild(b);
          dots.push(b);
        });

        var raf;
        function setActive() {
          var idx = Math.round(track.scrollLeft / track.clientWidth);
          idx = Math.max(0, Math.min(dots.length - 1, idx));
          dots.forEach(function (d, i) {
            d.setAttribute('aria-current', i === idx ? 'true' : 'false');
          });
        }
        track.addEventListener('scroll', function () {
          if (raf) cancelAnimationFrame(raf);
          raf = requestAnimationFrame(setActive);
        }, { passive: true });
      }

      var section = document.querySelector('[data-section-id="template--27416866160925__number_highlight_stats_zdJijJ"]');
      if (section) initTsCarousel(section);

      document.addEventListener('shopify:section:load', function (evt) {
        if (evt.detail.sectionId !== 'template--27416866160925__number_highlight_stats_zdJijJ') return;
        var reloaded = document.querySelector('[data-section-id="template--27416866160925__number_highlight_stats_zdJijJ"]');
        if (reloaded) initTsCarousel(reloaded);
      });
    })();
  </script>
</section><section id="shopify-section-template--27416866160925__included_features_grid_Hn8A7f" class="shopify-section"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://api.fontshare.com/v2/css?f[]=switzer@300,400,500&amp;display=swap" media="all">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto+Mono:wght@400;500&amp;display=swap" media="all"><section class="wi-template--27416866160925__included_features_grid_Hn8A7f" data-section-id="template--27416866160925__included_features_grid_Hn8A7f" data-section-type="section-whats-included">
  <div class="wi__inner"><header class="wi__head"><p class="wi__eyebrow">What's included</p><h2 class="wi__title">Every insight inside your TruAge™ report</h2><p class="wi__sub">75+ longevity biomarkers, organized into clear, actionable reports — each with personalized recommendations.</p></header><div class="wi__grid"><article class="wi__card">
            <div class="wi__card-head"><span class="wi__icon">
                  <img src="https://shop.trudiagnostic.com/cdn/shop/files/hourglass-01.svg?v=1786611798&amp;width=96" alt="OMICmAge™ Biological Age" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy">
                </span><h3 class="wi__ctitle">OMICmAge™ Biological Age</h3></div><p class="wi__desc">Your biological age from the most predictive aging algorithm, built with Harvard.</p></article><article class="wi__card">
            <div class="wi__card-head"><span class="wi__icon">
                  <img src="https://shop.trudiagnostic.com/cdn/shop/files/activity.svg?v=1786611798&amp;width=96" alt="SYMPHONYAge™ Organ Ages" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy">
                </span><h3 class="wi__ctitle">SYMPHONYAge™ Organ Ages</h3></div><p class="wi__desc">Epigenetic age for 11 organ systems, from Yale's system-specific clocks.</p></article><article class="wi__card">
            <div class="wi__card-head"><span class="wi__icon">
                  <img src="https://shop.trudiagnostic.com/cdn/shop/files/speedometer-04.svg?v=1786611798&amp;width=96" alt="DunedinPACE™ Aging Speed" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy">
                </span><h3 class="wi__ctitle">DunedinPACE™ Aging Speed</h3></div><p class="wi__desc">How fast you're aging right now, compared to a single calendar year.</p></article><article class="wi__card">
            <div class="wi__card-head"><span class="wi__icon">
                  <img src="https://shop.trudiagnostic.com/cdn/shop/files/Vector_7691313f-4914-4747-ac17-cb8e5eec65fd.svg?v=1786611797&amp;width=96" alt="Telomere Length" width="96" height="144" loading="lazy">
                </span><h3 class="wi__ctitle">Telomere Length</h3></div><p class="wi__desc">The length of your telomeres — a key marker of cellular aging.</p></article><article class="wi__card">
            <div class="wi__card-head"><span class="wi__icon">
                  <img src="https://shop.trudiagnostic.com/cdn/shop/files/immune.svg?v=1786611798&amp;width=96" alt="Immune Cell Report" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy">
                </span><h3 class="wi__ctitle">Immune Cell Report</h3></div><p class="wi__desc">Immune-health markers that reveal how your immune system is aging.</p></article><article class="wi__card">
            <div class="wi__card-head"><span class="wi__icon">
                  <img src="https://shop.trudiagnostic.com/cdn/shop/files/Flame.svg?v=1786611798&amp;width=96" alt="Inflammation Score" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy">
                </span><h3 class="wi__ctitle">Inflammation Score</h3></div><p class="wi__desc">Epigenetic CRP &amp; IL-6 — the hidden inflammation that drives aging.</p></article><article class="wi__card">
            <div class="wi__card-head"><span class="wi__icon">
                  <img src="https://shop.trudiagnostic.com/cdn/shop/files/dna_d3c77060-8afa-4089-ad54-2af655164cc1.svg?v=1786611798&amp;width=96" alt="Epigenetic Biomarkers™" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy">
                </span><h3 class="wi__ctitle">Epigenetic Biomarkers™</h3></div><p class="wi__desc">Clinical biomarkers — proteins, metabolites and clinical measures — estimated directly from your DNA methylation.</p></article><article class="wi__card">
