    (function () {
      var section = document.querySelector('[data-section-id="template--27416866160925__compare_plans_table_YcbXQV"]');
      if (!section) return;
      var tabs = section.querySelector('.cmp__tabs');
      if (!tabs || tabs.dataset.built) return;
      tabs.dataset.built = '1';

      tabs.querySelectorAll('[data-cmp-tab]').forEach(function (btn) {
        btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
          var target = btn.getAttribute('data-cmp-tab');
          tabs.querySelectorAll('[data-cmp-tab]').forEach(function (b) {
            b.setAttribute('aria-selected', b === btn ? 'true' : 'false');
          });
          section.querySelectorAll('[data-cmp-list]').forEach(function (list) {
            list.setAttribute('data-active', list.getAttribute('data-cmp-list') === target ? 'true' : 'false');
          });
        });
      });
    })();
  </script>
</section><section id="shopify-section-template--27416866160925__faq_accordion_Pj7mze" class="shopify-section"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://api.fontshare.com/v2/css?f[]=switzer@300,400,500&amp;display=swap" media="all"><section class="faq-template--27416866160925__faq_accordion_Pj7mze" data-section-id="template--27416866160925__faq_accordion_Pj7mze" data-section-type="faq-accordion">
  <div class="faq__inner">
    <header class="faq__head"><p class="faq__eyebrow">FAQ</p><h2 class="faq__title">Frequently asked questions</h2><p class="faq__sub">Everything you need to know before you order.</p><a class="faq__cta js-no-transition" href="https://shop.trudiagnostic.com/products/truage-complete-epigenetic-collection#">See full FAQ</a></header>

    <div class="faq__list"><details class="faq__item">
            <summary>What is the TruAge™ test, and how does it work?</summary>
            <div class="faq__answer"><p>TruAge™ analyzes your epigenetics through DNA methylation — chemical changes to your DNA that shift predictably with age and lifestyle — the same medical-grade technology used in leading academic aging studies. From a single blood spot sample, it calculates your biological age, your aging speed, and the age of 11 individual organ systems using algorithms developed with Harvard, Yale, and Duke.</p></div>
          </details><details class="faq__item">
            <summary>What is included in my TruAge™ test results?</summary>
            <div class="faq__answer"><p>TruAge™ shows you what your chronological age can't: how fast your body is actually aging, and where to focus. You'll see your overall biological age, your pace of aging, and organ-specific scores across 11 systems — plus personalized, science-backed recommendations you can act on. Retesting over time lets you see whether the changes you're making are actually working.</p></div>
          </details><details class="faq__item">
            <summary>Who should take TruAge™?</summary>
            <div class="faq__answer"><p>TruAge™ is built for adults who want a clear, data-driven picture of how they're aging — whether you're optimizing an existing health routine, working with a longevity-focused provider, or just curious how your lifestyle is showing up at the cellular level. No prescription or diagnosis required to take it.</p></div>
          </details><details class="faq__item">
            <summary>How accurate is TruAge™?</summary>
            <div class="faq__answer"><p>TruAge™ has a 98% test-retest reproducibility, meaning the same sample analyzed twice will return consistent results. The test is built on algorithms validated across more than 50 peer-reviewed publications, 80 academic collaborations, and over 100,000 processed samples.</p></div>
          </details><details class="faq__item">
            <summary>How often should I retest?</summary>
            <div class="faq__answer"><p>Because biological age responds to lifestyle changes, many customers retest every 3–6 months to track progress — which is why we offer a 4-test annual subscription at a discount over one-time purchases.</p></div>
          </details><details class="faq__item">
            <summary>Is TruAge™ HSA/FSA eligible?</summary>
            <div class="faq__answer"><p>Yes, TruAge™ qualifies for HSA/FSA reimbursement.</p></div>
          </details><details class="faq__item">
            <summary>How is my data protected?</summary>
            <div class="faq__answer"><p>Your sample and results are processed in a CLIA-certified lab and stored with industry-standard encryption and strict access controls.</p></div>
          </details></div>
  </div>
</section>


</section><section id="shopify-section-template--27416866160925__1720715007a7f9c81e" class="shopify-section"><div class="index-section"><div class="page-width"><div id="shopify-block-AVFRxMVdsdElDQjY2T__judge_me_reviews_review_widget_ULG9U4" class="shopify-block shopify-app-block">


