</div></div><div class="jdgm-medals-wrapper" data-updated-at="2026-08-12T03:51:55Z">  <div class="jdgm-medals jdgm-medals--rebranding" data-link="https://app.judge.me/reviews/medals"> <div class="jdgm-medals__container"> <div class="jdgm-medal-wrapper" title="Bronze Transparent Shop. Published at least 80% of verified reviews received in total"> <a class="jdgm-medal" data-value="87.5" data-type="tran" data-tier="bronze" aria-label="Judge.me Bronze Transparent Shop medal" target="_blank" href="https://app.judge.me/reviews/medals"> <div class="jdgm-medal__image" data-url="tran/bronze.svg" data-alt="Judge.me Bronze Transparent Shop medal"><img alt="Judge.me Bronze Transparent Shop medal" src="https://public-images.judge.me/judgeme/medals-v2-2025-rebranding/tran/bronze.svg?auto=format"></div> <div class="jdgm-medal__value ">87.5</div> </a> </div> </div> <div class="jdgm-verified-link-wrapper"><a class="jdgm-link jdgm-link--rebranding" href="https://app.judge.me/reviews/medals" target="_blank">Verified</a><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 17 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M1.41221 0C0.908409 0 0.5 0.408409 0.5 0.912207V15.0879C0.5 15.5917 0.908409 16.0001 1.41221 16.0001H15.5878C16.0916 16.0001 16.5 15.5917 16.5 15.0879V9.09481C16.5 8.80642 16.1485 8.66519 15.949 8.8734L12.7891 12.1708C11.4389 13.5797 10.0296 14.2803 8.56106 14.2725C7.10415 14.2763 5.72054 13.6231 4.41024 12.3128C3.01877 10.9213 2.28569 9.41149 2.21099 7.78333C2.15231 6.27994 2.73914 4.83048 3.97149 3.43497C4.1276 3.25818 4.39581 3.25584 4.56243 3.42246L7.33696 6.19699C7.50217 6.36219 7.50389 6.63088 7.35958 6.81526C6.68903 7.67203 6.66365 8.41032 7.28346 9.03013C7.90962 9.65629 8.60847 9.56682 9.38 8.76171L16.411 1.42462C16.4681 1.36505 16.5 1.28573 16.5 1.20322V0.912207C16.5 0.408409 16.0916 0 15.5878 0H1.41221Z" fill="#3EB2A2"></path></svg></div></div> </div></div>        </div> <div class="jdgm-row-actions"><div class="jdgm-rev-widg__sort-wrapper"><label class="jdgm-sort-dropdown-wrapper">
