</div></div><div class="jdgm-rev-widg__body">  <div class="jdgm-rev-widg__reviews"><div class="jdgm-rev jdgm-divider-top jdgm--done-setup" data-verified-buyer="true" data-review-id="707e3c15-426d-4859-997d-aa0a866c4a9c" data-review-language="" data-product-title="TruAge™ Test" data-product-url="/products/truage-complete-epigenetic-collection" data-thumb-up-count="0" data-thumb-down-count="0"> <div class="jdgm-rev__header"><div class="jdgm-row-product"></div><div class="jdgm-row-rating"><span class="jdgm-rev__rating" data-score="5" tabindex="0" aria-label="5 star review" role="img"> <span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span> </span><time class="jdgm-rev__timestamp" datetime="2025-12-22T17:04:04Z" data-content="2025-12-22 17:04:04 UTC">8 months ago</time></div><div class="jdgm-row-profile"><div class="jdgm-rev__icon"></div><span class="jdgm-rev__author-wrapper"> <span class="jdgm-rev__author">Hannah L.</span>   <span class="jdgm-rev__buyer-badge-wrapper"> <span class="jdgm-rev__buyer-badge"></span> </span></span></div><div class="jdgm-row-extra"><span class="jdgm-rev__location">  </span></div>         <div class="jdgm-rev__br"></div>   </div> <div class="jdgm-rev__content">   <b class="jdgm-rev__title">Love this test!!!</b> <div class="jdgm-rev__body"><p>Love this test!!! I take it every 3 months to help track my aging and epigenetic biomarkers from home. No need to go get vials and vials of blood drawn for 10 biomarkers. This test analyzes over 100 with a tiny amount of blood which has been so awesome and reliably consistent in helping me track my health.</p></div><div class="jdgm-rev__custom-form">  </div>   <div class="jdgm-rev__transparency-badge-wrapper">  <div class="jdgm-rev__transparency-badge" data-badge-type="review_collected_via_store_invitation" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: 4px 8px; margin-right: 2px; border-radius: 0px; border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123);">Review collected via store invitation</div>  </div> </div> <div class="jdgm-rev__actions"> <div class="jdgm-rev__social"></div> <div class="jdgm-rev__votes"></div> </div>  </div><div class="jdgm-rev jdgm-divider-top jdgm--done-setup" data-verified-buyer="false" data-review-id="1c46d589-e3b4-4518-850d-bd1e2b85ca22" data-review-language="" data-product-title="TruAge™ Test" data-product-url="/products/truage-complete-epigenetic-collection" data-thumb-up-count="0" data-thumb-down-count="0"> <div class="jdgm-rev__header"><div class="jdgm-row-product"></div><div class="jdgm-row-rating"><span class="jdgm-rev__rating" data-score="5" tabindex="0" aria-label="5 star review" role="img"> <span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span> </span><time class="jdgm-rev__timestamp" datetime="2025-06-05T18:00:59Z" data-content="2025-06-05 18:00:59 UTC">1 year ago</time></div><div class="jdgm-row-profile"><div class="jdgm-rev__icon"></div><span class="jdgm-rev__author-wrapper"> <span class="jdgm-rev__author">Kristina B.</span>   </span></div><div class="jdgm-row-extra"><span class="jdgm-rev__location">  </span></div>         <div class="jdgm-rev__br"></div>   </div> <div class="jdgm-rev__content">   <b class="jdgm-rev__title">Amazing kit!</b> <div class="jdgm-rev__body"><p>TruAge Test was very amazing to check my DNA and everything about my health state that an ordinary or usual test could not detect. It gives me a report of health risk which from that I'll be able to manage from an early stage. The kit was sealed, and the direction is very straight forward. It has a complete paraphernalia form cotton to bandage.</p></div><div class="jdgm-rev__custom-form">  </div>   <div class="jdgm-rev__transparency-badge-wrapper">  <div class="jdgm-rev__transparency-badge" data-badge-type="review_collected_from_store_visitor" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: 4px 8px; margin-right: 2px; border-radius: 0px; border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123);">Review collected from a store visitor</div>  </div> </div> <div class="jdgm-rev__actions"> <div class="jdgm-rev__social"></div> <div class="jdgm-rev__votes"></div> </div>  </div><div class="jdgm-rev jdgm-divider-top jdgm--done-setup" data-verified-buyer="false" data-review-id="55de7bac-2fcd-45e5-a543-7dfba6adff87" data-review-language="" data-product-title="TruAge™ Test" data-product-url="/products/truage-complete-epigenetic-collection" data-thumb-up-count="0" data-thumb-down-count="0"> <div class="jdgm-rev__header"><div class="jdgm-row-product"></div><div class="jdgm-row-rating"><span class="jdgm-rev__rating" data-score="5" tabindex="0" aria-label="5 star review" role="img"> <span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span> </span><time class="jdgm-rev__timestamp" datetime="2025-04-08T01:45:49Z" data-content="2025-04-08 01:45:49 UTC">1 year ago</time></div><div class="jdgm-row-profile"><div class="jdgm-rev__icon"></div><span class="jdgm-rev__author-wrapper"> <span class="jdgm-rev__author">Amber Malano</span>   </span></div><div class="jdgm-row-extra"><span class="jdgm-rev__location">  </span></div>         <div class="jdgm-rev__br"></div>   </div> <div class="jdgm-rev__content">   <b class="jdgm-rev__title">Worth it!</b> <div class="jdgm-rev__body"><p>I am a functional medicine practitioner and see and run many of different types of lab testing. I was really thrilled with my experience of the TruAge test - it took 5 minutes to do the test and for the amount of results I received, it was pretty remarkable! Highly recommend this for optimizing health and worth it for the price point and amount of data you get from the results.</p></div><div class="jdgm-rev__custom-form">  </div> <div class="jdgm-rev__pics">  <a class="jdgm-rev__pic-link jdgm--loading js-no-transition" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" href="https://review-images.judgeme.com/trudiagnostic/1744076749__truagediagnosticstest__original.jpeg?quality=80&amp;width=1024" data-mfp-src="https://review-images.judgeme.com/trudiagnostic/1744076749__truagediagnosticstest__original.jpeg?quality=80&amp;width=1024" aria-label="Amber Malano review photo 1"> <img class="jdgm-rev__pic-img" alt="Amber Malano review photo" data-src="https://review-images.judgeme.com/trudiagnostic/1744076749__truagediagnosticstest__original.jpeg?quality=80&amp;width=160"> </a>  </div>  <div class="jdgm-rev__transparency-badge-wrapper">  <div class="jdgm-rev__transparency-badge" data-badge-type="review_collected_from_store_visitor" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: 4px 8px; margin-right: 2px; border-radius: 0px; border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123);">Review collected from a store visitor</div>  </div> </div> <div class="jdgm-rev__actions"> <div class="jdgm-rev__social"></div> <div class="jdgm-rev__votes"></div> </div>  </div><div class="jdgm-rev jdgm-divider-top jdgm--done-setup" data-verified-buyer="false" data-review-id="34ab3179-5caa-44d8-b04f-8eca59f78c61" data-review-language="" data-product-title="TruAge™ Test" data-product-url="/products/truage-complete-epigenetic-collection" data-thumb-up-count="0" data-thumb-down-count="0"> <div class="jdgm-rev__header"><div class="jdgm-row-product"></div><div class="jdgm-row-rating"><span class="jdgm-rev__rating" data-score="5" tabindex="0" aria-label="5 star review" role="img"> <span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span> </span><time class="jdgm-rev__timestamp" datetime="2025-04-04T19:51:58Z" data-content="2025-04-04 19:51:58 UTC">1 year ago</time></div><div class="jdgm-row-profile"><div class="jdgm-rev__icon"></div><span class="jdgm-rev__author-wrapper"> <span class="jdgm-rev__author">Xiane</span>   </span></div><div class="jdgm-row-extra"><span class="jdgm-rev__location">  </span></div>         <div class="jdgm-rev__br"></div>   </div> <div class="jdgm-rev__content">   <b class="jdgm-rev__title">Next-Level Health Data—Thanks, TruDiagnostic!</b> <div class="jdgm-rev__body"><p>The experience was surprisingly simple and hassle-free, especially for someone like me who isn’t a fan of pricking or blood. The process was quick, efficient, and completely comfortable. I’m genuinely excited to receive my results. The science behind it is fascinating, and it’s reassuring to know that I’m getting data that can actually help me improve my health. It feels like a big step forward in how we approach medicine, and I’m excited to see what I can do with this information.  Huge thanks to TruDiagnostic for making this possible 🥳😁</p></div><div class="jdgm-rev__custom-form">  </div> <div class="jdgm-rev__pics">  <a class="jdgm-rev__pic-link jdgm--loading js-no-transition" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" href="https://review-images.judgeme.com/trudiagnostic/1743796318__screenshot2025-04-04125028__original.png?quality=80&amp;width=1024" data-mfp-src="https://review-images.judgeme.com/trudiagnostic/1743796318__screenshot2025-04-04125028__original.png?quality=80&amp;width=1024" aria-label="Xiane review photo 1"> <img class="jdgm-rev__pic-img" alt="Xiane review photo" data-src="https://review-images.judgeme.com/trudiagnostic/1743796318__screenshot2025-04-04125028__original.png?quality=80&amp;width=160"> </a>  </div>  <div class="jdgm-rev__transparency-badge-wrapper">  <div class="jdgm-rev__transparency-badge" data-badge-type="review_collected_from_store_visitor" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: 4px 8px; margin-right: 2px; border-radius: 0px; border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123);">Review collected from a store visitor</div>  </div> </div> <div class="jdgm-rev__actions"> <div class="jdgm-rev__social"></div> <div class="jdgm-rev__votes"></div> </div>  </div><div class="jdgm-rev jdgm-divider-top jdgm--done-setup" data-verified-buyer="false" data-review-id="aec02e5b-62ba-4ff7-b76e-cf8d6edd7e74" data-review-language="" data-product-title="TruAge™ Test" data-product-url="/products/truage-complete-epigenetic-collection" data-thumb-up-count="0" data-thumb-down-count="0"> <div class="jdgm-rev__header"><div class="jdgm-row-product"></div><div class="jdgm-row-rating"><span class="jdgm-rev__rating" data-score="5" tabindex="0" aria-label="5 star review" role="img"> <span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span> </span><time class="jdgm-rev__timestamp" datetime="2025-04-03T10:51:21Z" data-content="2025-04-03 10:51:21 UTC">1 year ago</time></div><div class="jdgm-row-profile"><div class="jdgm-rev__icon"></div><span class="jdgm-rev__author-wrapper"> <span class="jdgm-rev__author">Angela</span>   </span></div><div class="jdgm-row-extra"><span class="jdgm-rev__location">  </span></div>         <div class="jdgm-rev__br"></div>   </div> <div class="jdgm-rev__content">   <b class="jdgm-rev__title">Exceptional Customer Service and Great Results!</b> <div class="jdgm-rev__body"><p>This TruAge testing kit was fantastic—simple process, fast results, and super detailed information. Their customer service was top-notch, always friendly and quick to assist. Highly recommended!</p></div><div class="jdgm-rev__custom-form">  </div>   <div class="jdgm-rev__transparency-badge-wrapper">  <div class="jdgm-rev__transparency-badge" data-badge-type="review_collected_from_store_visitor" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: 4px 8px; margin-right: 2px; border-radius: 0px; border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123);">Review collected from a store visitor</div>  </div> </div> <div class="jdgm-rev__actions"> <div class="jdgm-rev__social"></div> <div class="jdgm-rev__votes"></div> </div>  </div></div> <div class="jdgm-paginate" data-per-page="5" data-url="https://api.judge.me/reviews/reviews_for_widget"><a class="jdgm-paginate__page jdgm-curt" data-page="1" aria-label="Page 1" tabindex="0" aria-current="page" role="button">1</a><a class="jdgm-paginate__page " data-page="2" aria-label="Page 2" tabindex="0" role="button">2</a><a class="jdgm-paginate__page " data-page="3" aria-label="Page 3" tabindex="0" role="button">3</a><a class="jdgm-paginate__page jdgm-paginate__next-page" data-page="2" aria-label="Page 2" tabindex="0" rel="next" role="button"></a><a class="jdgm-paginate__page jdgm-paginate__last-page" data-page="14" aria-label="Page 14" tabindex="0" role="button"></a></div>  </div> <div class="jdgm-rev-widg__paginate-spinner-wrapper"> <div class="jdgm-spinner"></div> </div> </div>
      </div>
    
    
    
  

  
